About the project:
We are looking for manual testers who would like to join our development team. Their task is to navigate through the modules at our client, from which product prices are collected and processed for marketing purposes.
The project is currently offered on a month-to-month basis, with the possibility of extension depending on the client's needs and project continuation.
Responsibilites:

• As QA Engineer you will be making functional test scenarios;

• You will be conducting manual tests for mobile devices - Both for Android and iOS;

• You will be helping team with reporting bugs;

• You will be performing manual testing for mobile applications;

• You will be performing regression testing;

• You will be executing tests using different methodologies - preferred black/white box methodology;

• You will be collecting and confirming requirements during daily conversations;

• You will be giving feedback about progress of your work.

