• Own the commercial systems strategy and roadmap. Translate launch milestones and business objectives into sequenced investments, clear priorities, and measurable outcomes across CRM, commercial data, field enablement, and connected commercial platforms.&nbsp;

• Establish business ownership and decision-making for commercial systems. Align stakeholders on requirements, process changes, data definitions, priorities, and acceptance criteria; resolve competing demands and escalate material tradeoffs.&nbsp;

